        editorPosition: {x: 57.304188, y: 8.695725}
        speakerId: Glow (quiet, aside to the player)
        text: "Before you go back to them, listen with your emotional sensitivity.
          Don\u2019t stop at their words alone\u2026 look at what they seem to feel
          behind their anger. Listening is often the first step toward calming things."
